---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What bolder collects, why, and who processes it. Payments are handled by Stripe; no card details ever reach this site."
  path="/policies/privacy"
>
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="page prose">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>

      <p class="draft-warning">
        <strong>Draft:</strong> review before publishing. Accurate as to how the site is built,
        but not legal advice.
      </p>

      <p class="lede">
        bolder is a one-person studio in Toronto. This site collects as little as it can.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Orders</strong> — your name, email and shipping address, so your ring can reach you.</li>
        <li><strong>Custom requests</strong> — whatever you enter in the form, so I can reply.</li>
        <li><strong>Your cart</strong> — stored in your own browser. It never leaves your device until you check out.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Payments</h2>
      <p>
        Payments are processed by <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Stripe</a>.
        Card details are entered on Stripe’s own checkout and never touch this site or its servers.
      </p>

      <h2>Who else sees your data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing and order records.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting and content delivery.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivering order and enquiry emails.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your information is never sold or shared for advertising.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        No advertising or tracking cookies are set. Your cart uses your browser’s local storage,
        which stays on your device.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:boldermade@gmail.com">boldermade@gmail.com</a> to ask what is held
        about you, or to have it deleted.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .page { max-width: var(--w-prose); }
  .page h1 { margin-bottom: var(--s-4); }
  .draft-warning { padding: var(--s-4); border: 1px solid var(--c-sale); border-radius: var(--r-md); color: var(--c-sale); font-size: var(--t-sm); }
</style>
